# TTS streaming synthesis
# @robonix.grpc stream_server
# abstract_interface_id: robonix/sys/speech/tts/synthesize_stream
#
# Client sends one SynthesizeStreamRequest; server streams back AudioChunk.
# Use for low-latency playback while text is still being generated.
---
string text
string language
string voice
float32 speed
===
# (empty — streaming RPC, no single response body)
